# INVWINIC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: CTRL+D in the
# item list and CTRL+E in the item form at level 2 (CLERK).  CTRL+D on
# item 1 copies it as item 4, shown in edit mode with item 1's values and
# notes but no serial number; ESC on it unchanged asks nothing and
# deletes the copy again, the list as it was, item 1 still selected, with
# no note.  CTRL+D on item 2 copies it as item 5, whose quantity changed
# and saved by ENTER (OK) shows in the list, the status bar saying "Item
# 5 saved".  CTRL+E in item 2's form in view mode shows it in edit mode,
# as level 2 may, and ESC leaves it unchanged.  CTRL+D on item 1 again
# copies it as item 6, whose tag a*b the server refuses; ESC then asks,
# and Yes leaves the copy, kept as its OK sent a save, the status bar
# saying "Copied as item 6"; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINIC.SNP is its snapshot.
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER
K CTRL-D
S COPY
K ESC
S COPIED
# item 2's copy: 5 TABs from the category reach the quantity
K DOWN CTRL-D TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB
T 5
K ENTER
S SAVED
K ENTER CTRL-E
S EDIT
# item 1's copy, its OK refused for its tag: once OK has sent it, ESC
# and Yes keep the copy, noted
K ESC HOME CTRL-D ALT-G
T a*b
K ENTER
S REFUSED
K ESC Y
S KEPT
K ALT-F X
